  "question": {
    "text": "The locus of a point which divides the line segment joining the point <math><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mi></mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced></math> and a point on the parabola&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn><mi>y</mi></math> internally in the ratio <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>1</mn><mo>:</mo><mn>2</mn></math> is:",
